<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="about__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow about__eyebrow">About</span>

    <p class="about__lede">
      I'm an engineer who grew up<br>
      <em class="serif-italic">building for communities.</em><br>
      Understand how people work,<br>
      Discern their real needs,<br>
      And ship what fits.
    </p>

    <p class="about__body">
      Seven years professionally on AWS &mdash; cloud-native infrastructure, event-driven
      systems, full-stack applications &mdash; most recently at United Airlines where
      I drove on-prem to cloud system migrations and led a cross-team effort that resolved
      16,000+ CVEs in a year. I've worked across startups and enterprises, adapted to various
      stacks, and built a strong intuition for how to read a team's needs and design solutions
      that support long-term growth and sustainable operations.
    </p>

    <p class="about__body">
      Alongside that, I fostered and grew a niche fighting game community, lifting offline major
      event attendance from under 100 to 200+ players. I built tools that streamline online
      tournament organization for more organizers to support their communities, and I mentor both
      engineers and competitors in the scenes I'm part of.
    </p>

    <p class="about__body">
      I'm currently building, learning, and <strong>open to freelance and full-time work</strong>.
      If you're looking for someone who can step into a complex workflow, drive team growth,
      and build sustainable solutions, <a href="#contact">get in touch</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
